      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.2692
    },
    {
      "id": "acronyms_05",
      "category": "acronyms",
      "text": "Our SQL queries hit the CDN cache about 80% of the time.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/acronyms_05.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.0583,
      "audio_seconds": 4.2,
      "rtf": 0.252,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3168
    },
    {
      "id": "acronyms_06",
      "category": "acronyms",
      "text": "The NVIDIA driver needs a reboot before CUDA will initialise.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/acronyms_06.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.9134,
      "audio_seconds": 3.56,
      "rtf": 0.2566,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4244
    },
    {
      "id": "acronyms_07",
      "category": "acronyms",
      "text": "Attach the CSV and the JSON export to the same email.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/acronyms_07.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.9582,
      "audio_seconds": 3.8,
      "rtf": 0.2522,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.6283
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_00",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Although the tests passed locally, the build failed in CI, which nobody noticed until Monday.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/complex_00.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.3599,
      "audio_seconds": 5.48,
      "rtf": 0.2482,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4049
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_01",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The report, which had been delayed twice already, finally arrived without the appendix.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/complex_01.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.1269,
      "audio_seconds": 4.56,
      "rtf": 0.2471,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.5251
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_02",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "If the connection drops mid-upload, the client retries; otherwise, it reports success immediately.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/complex_02.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.2188,
      "audio_seconds": 4.92,
      "rtf": 0.2477,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.603
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_03",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "What surprised us was not that it failed, but how long it took anyone to notice.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/complex_03.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.0044,
      "audio_seconds": 4.0,
      "rtf": 0.2511,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.5489
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_04",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "He said, quite reasonably, that the deadline had never been agreed in writing.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/complex_04.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.0676,
      "audio_seconds": 4.28,
      "rtf": 0.2494,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3498
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_05",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The system works — assuming, of course, that the cache has been warmed first.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/complex_05.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.9864,
      "audio_seconds": 3.92,
      "rtf": 0.2516,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4214
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_06",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Before deploying, verify the image was rebuilt; a stale image looks identical from outside.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/complex_06.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.3854,
      "audio_seconds": 5.56,
      "rtf": 0.2492,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3764
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_07",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "She wanted to know why, given everything that had happened, we were still shipping on Friday.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/complex_07.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.1749,
      "audio_seconds": 4.68,
      "rtf": 0.251,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4339
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_00",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "I read the report yesterday, and I will read the summary tonight.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/heteronyms_00.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.8278,
      "audio_seconds": 3.24,
      "rtf": 0.2555,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3544
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_01",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "The lead engineer removed the lead pipe from the basement.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/heteronyms_01.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.7344,
      "audio_seconds": 2.88,
      "rtf": 0.255,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.2928
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_02",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "They live near the studio where the live broadcast is recorded.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/heteronyms_02.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.8068,
      "audio_seconds": 3.16,
      "rtf": 0.2553,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.338
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_03",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "He plays bass guitar, though he would rather be fishing for bass.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/heteronyms_03.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.8974,
      "audio_seconds": 3.52,
      "rtf": 0.2549,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3335
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_04",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "Please close the door; the exit is close to the stairwell.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/heteronyms_04.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.8373,
      "audio_seconds": 3.32,
      "rtf": 0.2522,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.2819
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_05",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "The dove dove straight into the hedge without slowing down.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/heteronyms_05.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.7568,
      "audio_seconds": 2.96,
      "rtf": 0.2557,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3758
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_06",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "We must record the meeting and file the record with the board.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/heteronyms_06.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.8077,
      "audio_seconds": 3.12,
      "rtf": 0.2589,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3222
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_07",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "The wind was strong enough to wind the flag around the pole.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s7/heteronyms_07.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.7842,
      "audio_seconds": 3.0,
